                        <!-- Introduction (updated for plots) -->
                        <section class="blog-section">
                            <p>Welcome to our comprehensive guide on <strong>Rishabraj Anuja Borivali</strong>, an exceptional residential development located at <strong>Borivali West, Mumbai</strong>. In this detailed article, we'll explore everything you need to know about this prestigious residential project by <strong>H Rishabraj Group</strong>.</p>
                                                        <div class="highlight-box">
                                <p><strong>Quick Summary:</strong> Rishabraj Anuja Borivali offers 
                                    1, 2, 2 + 2, 3 BHK with prices starting at ₹ 1.40 Cr - 2.93 Cr Onwards. The project is RERA approved and promises exceptional lifestyle amenities.</p>
                            </div>
                                                        <div class="mini-cta"><p><strong>Interested in Rishabraj Anuja Borivali?</strong> Get priority access to exclusive offers and detailed information.</p><button class="cta-button enqModal" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#enqModal" data-form="lg" data-title="Get Priority Access" data-btn="Get Priority Access" data-enquiry="Priority Access Request">Get Priority Access</button></div>
                        </section>
                        <!-- Project Overview (unchanged, but we'll keep as is because pro_desc already contains generic text) -->
                        <section class="blog-section">
                            <h2>Project Overview</h2>
                            <p>Rishabraj Anuja Borivali is a residential project developed by H Rishabraj Group. Located at Borivali West, Mumbai, this project offers a perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience for modern living.</p>
                                                        <div class="highlight-box"><p><b>H Rishabraj Anuja </b>is a premium new launch residential project by H Rishabraj Developers located in the heart of <b>Borivali West, Western Mumbai</b>. Designed for modern urban living, the project offers thoughtfully planned homes in a well-connected and well-developed neighborhood. Spread across 0.25 acres, H Rishabraj Anuja features 2 residential towers with 6 floors, housing a total of 34 exclusive units.</p><p><span style="font-size: 1rem;">The project is <b>RERA registered (PR1180002501316)</b>, ensuring complete transparency and buyer confidence. With possession scheduled for June 2028, H Rishabraj Anuja is an ideal choice for both homebuyers and investors seeking long-term value in Borivali West.</span></p></div>
