                        <section class="blog-section">
                            <h2>Pricing & Configuration Details</h2>
                            <p>Understanding the pricing structure is crucial when considering a home investment. At Rishabraj Anuja Borivali, you'll find a range of options to suit different family needs and budgets.</p>
                                                        <div class="highlight-box">
                                <h3>Available Configurations</h3>
                                <ul><li><strong>1 BHK:</strong> Area: 435 – 455 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request</li><li><strong>2 BHK:</strong> Area: 660 – 726 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request</li><li><strong>2 BHK + 2 BHK:</strong> Area: On Request sq.ft. | Price: On Request</li><li><strong>3 BHK:</strong> Area: 935 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request</li></ul>
                            </div>
