                        <!-- Floor Plans – for plots we show plot layouts -->
                        <section class="blog-section">
                            <h2>Thoughtful Floor Plans</h2>
                            <p>The floor plans at Rishabraj Anuja Borivali are designed with modern living in mind, maximizing space utilization.</p>
                                                        <p>The project offers 3 different floor plan options to cater to various family sizes and preferences.</p>
                            <div class="highlight-box"><h3>Available Floor Plans</h3><ul><li><strong>2 BHK:</strong> Designed for optimal space utilization and comfort</li><li><strong>Floor Plan :</strong> Designed for optimal space utilization and comfort</li><li><strong>Floor Plan :</strong> Designed for optimal space utilization and comfort</li></ul></div>
